        <mxCell id="legA" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#333333;spacingLeft=4;" value="①  Tap an agent, send text, pick an image or file, hold to record, retry, drag to reorder&lt;br&gt;②  StateFlow&amp;lt;UiState&amp;gt; collected by Compose; recomposition is the only render path&lt;br&gt;③  connect(), sendMessage(), ensureActiveSession(), persistMessage(), respondToApproval()&lt;br&gt;④  Flow&amp;lt;ChatEvent&amp;gt;, StateFlow&amp;lt;ConnectionState&amp;gt;, List&amp;lt;ChatItem&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;⑤  Interfaces only — no implementation type crosses this line&lt;br&gt;⑥  Flow&amp;lt;List&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;&amp;gt; from Room, and Result&amp;lt;T&amp;gt; from network-backed repositories" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="565" x="55" y="928" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legB" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#333333;spacingLeft=4;" value="⑦  ChatMessageEntity, ChatSessionEntity, SessionStateEntity, AgentEntity, PendingMessageEntity&lt;br&gt;⑧  Agent address, resumed session_id, prompt text, encoded attachments&lt;br&gt;⑨  CONNECT (Ed25519-signed), INPUT, PONG, ASK_USER_RESPONSE, APPROVAL_RESPONSE,&lt;br&gt;     ONBOARD_SUBMIT — plus HTTPS for discovery, account and transcription&lt;br&gt;⑩  CONNECTED, llm_call / llm_result, thinking, tool_call / tool_result, assistant,&lt;br&gt;     agent_image, session_sync, ask_user, approval_needed, ONBOARD_*, OUTPUT, ERROR, PING&lt;br&gt;⑪  Image and audio bytes written to app-private storage &lt;i&gt;before&lt;/i&gt; sending; the UI then&lt;br&gt;     refers to a durable file:// path instead of an expiring picker URI&lt;br&gt;⑫  Only the Ed25519 signature crosses; the private key never leaves the Android Keystore" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="560" x="630" y="928" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
